# S14z, guest g: a new account too (the campaign bot's new game). The title gives it the room story at game start
# (empty: revision 0), so it plays the lobby's first visit; its lobby progress (phase 1 and 501) goes up while the owner
# has not started the story: refused not_started and dropped (with the notice once). Its barrier into stagML02 (the new
# game's next stage) removes those values from its engine (501 is 0 there) and tells it why.
campaign until stage=stagml11
talk until control,frames>=60
log guest in the lobby
idle until frames>=900
campaign until stage=stagml02
log guest in stagml02
idle until frames>=120 fail flag:501=1
log 501 removed
idle until frames>=60
